require from an insurer, principal agent, chief agent, or special agent such information, certified if so required by an auditor or actuary, as he may consider necessary;

require an insurer, principal agent, chief agent, or special agent to submit for his examination as the principal place of business of the insurer in 1India), any book of account, register or other document, or to supply any statement which may be specified in the notice;

